    "Being broadly connected to rock is not enough: Dookie and Appetite For Destruction appeal, but I would choose heavier, more intricate music first today."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent listen to 10.000 Days makes another Tool album especially appealing, beyond simply finding another rock album.",
    "My repeated listening to heavy albums matters more right now than isolated lighter choices, and I particularly want intensity paired with melody or intricate playing."
